KEEP CHARGE GROUP2
GROUP3  O(5) H(12) H(13)
KEEP CHARGE GROUP3
!------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!GROUP2   atom1 atom2 ...
KEEP     kappa  1  2  3  4
KEEP     charge group1
!KEEP     rigid group1
!RESET    bond C(1) H(1) 1.09 ...
! RESET BOND O(2) H(1) 0.960720! it was 0.819998 A before.
! RESET BOND O(4) H(2) 0.960720! it was 0.819997 A before.
! RESET BOND C(2) H(3) 1.101030! it was 0.980002 A before.
